  "prompt": "How many units were sold in each month of the first quarter of 2025? Use the sales table and its order_month column, the first day of the month the order was placed in. Count order lines dated from 1 January 2025 to 31 March 2025, both days included. Return two columns, in this order: order_month and units_sold, the sum of units. Return one row per order_month, sorted by order_month from earliest to latest. Order lines with missing units add nothing to the total.",
